    "body": "The idea here was to define a concept of certain browser specific requirements that are implementation specific while being able to refer to them below so that pause-when-unmute uses the same requirements.\nSpecifying the requirements to be a user gesture wasn't an intent of this PR, user agents seems to have different requirements (for instance, Chrome, Safari and Firefox).\n",
